<title>USA: NYCE certificated cotton stocks drop to 135,468.</title>
<headline>NYCE certificated cotton stocks drop to 135,468.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of July 8 totaled 135,468 bales, down from 136,005 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, 260 bales awaiting review, 537 cancellations, and 1,219 decertification orders.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
